1559
00:56:45,159 --> 00:56:46,752
- It's so spicy!
- Isn't it delicious?

1560
00:56:46,752 --> 00:56:48,650
- It's so delicious!
- Isn't it so delicious?

1561
00:56:48,650 --> 00:56:52,344
