1565
00:56:56,423 --> 00:56:58,295
- Okay, Rock-Paper-Scissors!
- Let's go!

1566
00:56:58,295 --> 00:57:00,557
- Shoot or lose! Rock-Paper-Scissors!
- Rock-Paper-Scissors!

1567
00:57:00,557 --> 00:57:01,763
- Rock-Paper-Scissors!
- Rock-Paper-Scissors!

1568
00:57:01,763 --> 00:57:03,866
