1571
00:57:06,695 --> 00:57:08,702
Shoot or lose! Rock-Paper-Scissors!

1572
00:57:08,702 --> 00:57:10,844
Rock-Paper-Scissors!
Rock-Paper-Scissors!

1573
00:57:10,844 --> 00:57:11,972
