- A bad person.

1622
00:59:03,144 --> 00:59:04,044
Oh, what should I do…?

1623
00:59:04,044 --> 00:59:06,444
- It's only funny if you eat it all.
- The broth is so good.

1624
00:59:06,444 --> 00:59:07,877
It's only funny if you eat it all.

1625
00:59:07,877 --> 00:59:10,743
