- Don't worry.

1628
00:59:13,944 --> 00:59:16,043
[Bad person]
Go with your human instincts!

1629
00:59:16,910 --> 00:59:17,944
I'll…I'll leave you some, DAWN.

1630
00:59:17,944 --> 00:59:19,630
Yeah, you should still leave him some.

1631
00:59:20,170 --> 00:59:21,962
You end up scraping at it.

1632
00:59:21,962 --> 00:59:24,043
