- You end up scraping at it.

1633
00:59:24,043 --> 00:59:25,844
[He finally starts eating]

1634
00:59:25,844 --> 00:59:28,122
Oh, he's leaving some! He's leaving some!

1635
00:59:28,122 --> 00:59:30,065
