5, 6, 7, 8!

2093
01:14:08,144 --> 01:14:10,811
♪ APT. APT. APT. APT. ♪

2094
01:14:10,811 --> 01:14:12,411
♪ Uh, uh-huh, uh-huh! ♪

2095
01:14:12,411 --> 01:14:15,044
♪ APT. APT. APT. APT. ♪

2096
01:14:15,044 --> 01:14:16,511
- 13th floor!
- 13th floor!

2097
01:14:16,511 --> 01:14:18,343
- 13th floor!
- 13th floor!

2098
01:14:18,343 --> 01:14:18,844
1!

2099
01:14:18,844 --> 01:14:19,411
2!

2100
01:14:19,411 --> 01:14:20,177
3!

2101
01:14:20,177 --> 01:14:20,911
4!

2102
01:14:20,911 --> 01:14:21,444
5!

2103
01:14:21,444 --> 01:14:22,111
6!

2104
01:14:22,111 --> 01:14:22,644
7!

2105
01:14:22,644 --> 01:14:23,244
8!

2106
01:14:23,244 --> 01:14:24,043
9!

2107
01:14:24,043 --> 01:14:24,677
10!

2108
01:14:24,677 --> 01:14:25,277
11!

2109
01:14:25,277 --> 01:14:25,844
12!

2110
01:14:25,844 --> 01:14:26,436
(13)
Hey!!!

2111
01:14:26,436 --> 01:14:28,038
[Yo Han eliminated again]
Wow!

2112
01:14:28,038 --> 01:14:29,611
Out!

2113
01:14:29,611 --> 01:14:32,282
Hold on a second! I'll block DAWN!

2114
01:14:32,282 --> 01:14:33,479
- Lee Teuk, please!
- I'll stop him!

2115
01:14:33,479 --> 01:14:34,384
Please!

2116
01:14:34,384 --> 01:14:35,944
[They must stop DAWN, who's currently in the lead]

2117
01:14:35,944 --> 01:14:37,733
- Wait.
- You're my only hope now, Lee Teuk!

2118
01:14:37,733 --> 01:14:40,028
[Currently has 1 point]
If DAWN wins here,

2119
01:14:40,028 --> 01:14:41,877
DAWN will get a status upgrade!

2120
01:14:41,877 --> 01:14:44,269
[Currently has 0 points]
If Lee Teuk wins, we go to the next game.

2121
01:14:44,269 --> 01:14:45,909
Are we playing Apartment again?

2122
01:14:45,909 --> 01:14:46,950
[Please]
Well, we're playing Apartment now.

2123
01:14:46,950 --> 01:14:48,437
- Let's play Apartment.
- You two are playing Apartment.

2124
01:14:48,437 --> 01:14:50,332
When we sing "APT.", please dance with us.

2125
01:14:50,332 --> 01:14:51,868
I love this dance so much.

2126
01:14:51,868 --> 01:14:54,641
[Forget the status upgrade]
We'll add the "Uh-huh" part in the middle.

2127
01:14:54,641 --> 01:14:56,344
[44-year-old at peak condition today]
We'll add the "Uh-huh" in.

2128
01:14:56,344 --> 01:14:57,743
[Apartment. Finals]
5, 6, 7, 8!

2129
01:14:57,743 --> 01:15:00,511
♪ APT. APT. APT. APT. ♪

2130
01:15:00,511 --> 01:15:02,011
♪ Uh, uh-huh, uh-huh! ♪

2131
01:15:02,011 --> 01:15:05,032
♪ APT. APT. APT. APT. ♪

2132
01:15:05,032 --> 01:15:05,960
[17th floor]
17!

2133
01:15:05,960 --> 01:15:06,977
To 17 we go!

2134
01:15:06,977 --> 01:15:07,677
1!

2135
01:15:07,677 --> 01:15:08,211
2!

2136
01:15:08,211 --> 01:15:08,777
3!

2137
01:15:08,777 --> 01:15:09,244
4!

2138
01:15:09,244 --> 01:15:09,844
5!

2139
01:15:09,844 --> 01:15:10,577
6!

2140
01:15:10,577 --> 01:15:11,177
7!

2141
01:15:11,177 --> 01:15:11,677
8!

2142
01:15:11,677 --> 01:15:12,211
9!

2143
01:15:12,211 --> 01:15:12,844
10!

2144
01:15:12,844 --> 01:15:13,370
11!

2145
01:15:13,370 --> 01:15:13,884
12!

2146
01:15:13,884 --> 01:15:14,377
13!

2147
01:15:14,377 --> 01:15:14,977
14!

2148
01:15:14,977 --> 01:15:15,511
15!

2149
01:15:15,511 --> 01:15:15,977
16!

2150
01:15:15,977 --> 01:15:18,909
(17)
[Lee Teuk gets the 17th-floor-apartment]

2151
01:15:21,834 --> 01:15:22,648
Agh!!!!

2152
01:15:22,648 --> 01:15:23,877
And just like that,

2153
01:15:23,877 --> 01:15:26,745
[DAWN confirmed as a commoner]
DAWN gets a status upgrade!

2154
01:15:28,061 --> 01:15:29,449
[Lee Teuk and Yo Han confirmed as paupers]
No way, no way!

2155
01:15:29,449 --> 01:15:31,377
You two are confirmed as paupers!

2156
01:15:31,377 --> 01:15:32,411
What is this?

2157
01:15:32,411 --> 01:15:33,729
[Lee Teuk and Yo Han, who tried to impress the princes]
I'll go and come back!

2158
01:15:33,729 --> 01:15:35,548
- I'll go!
- Anyone who wants to go can go.

2159
01:15:36,713 --> 01:15:38,081
[They fell into the water]

2160
01:15:38,081 --> 01:15:39,644
- Yo Han's good at swimming.
- So cool!

2161
01:15:39,644 --> 01:15:40,584
[They choked on water]
What's going on?

2162
01:15:40,584 --> 01:15:42,819
What? What's happening?

2163
01:15:42,819 --> 01:15:44,126
[They groveled and sucked up]
Oh, our prince!

2164
01:15:44,126 --> 01:15:45,944
This is nice. I love this kind of thing.

2165
01:15:45,944 --> 01:15:48,244
I threw my pride in the trash.

2166
01:15:48,244 --> 01:15:50,348
[But the scores reset]
Forget all the points you've gotten so far!

2167
01:15:50,348 --> 01:15:51,811
What are you talking about?

2168
01:15:51,811 --> 01:15:53,811
I worked hard for those points...

2169
01:15:53,811 --> 01:15:56,135
Shin Dong should've been stripped of his title!

2170
01:15:56,135 --> 01:15:57,801
Right? That was seriously so shady.

2171
01:15:57,801 --> 01:15:59,350
- We came as a trio!
- Fail!

2172
01:15:59,350 --> 01:16:02,272
[After being eliminated
repeatedly from the games]

2173
01:16:02,272 --> 01:16:03,440
[they were finally confirmed as paupers]
Are there any last-minute comebacks?

2174
01:16:03,440 --> 01:16:05,345
- No.
- This game doesn't count!

2175
01:16:05,345 --> 01:16:06,904
- Why, why?
- This game doesn't count!

2176
01:16:06,904 --> 01:16:08,144
- Why, why?
- No, no, no!

2177
01:16:08,144 --> 01:16:09,875
- It's so fun though
- No, no, no!

2178
01:16:09,875 --> 01:16:11,141
[Except the paupers]
[Everyone had a great time]

2179
01:16:11,141 --> 01:16:13,277
And that brings us to the end!

2180
01:16:13,277 --> 01:16:15,644
To everyone who watched "ALL or NOTHING",

2181
01:16:15,644 --> 01:16:17,044
- thank you!
- We're wrapping up already?

2182
01:16:17,044 --> 01:16:21,024
For today's last item,
we'll check out the paupers' accommodation.

2183
01:16:21,024 --> 01:16:22,950
I'm so cold right now.

2184
01:16:22,950 --> 01:16:24,144
Do we even have blankets?

2185
01:16:24,144 --> 01:16:25,843
(Commoner)
I'm cold.

2186
01:16:25,843 --> 01:16:26,936
[Paupers]
Do we even have blankets?

2187
01:16:26,936 --> 01:16:29,144
Our two paupers have
one last jump in the water waiting for them!

2188
01:16:29,144 --> 01:16:31,144
Hey, Ji Sung! Why are you
going there all of a sudden?

2189
01:16:31,144 --> 01:16:33,425
Our statuses are different now.

2190
01:16:33,425 --> 01:16:34,344
The commoners are over here.

2191
01:16:34,344 --> 01:16:36,711
Ji Sung and I have spent
a lot of time as paupers together.

2192
01:16:36,711 --> 01:16:39,544
My pauper mate Ji Sung has leveled up,

2193
01:16:39,544 --> 01:16:42,810
and now he's a commoner,
so I'm happy with that.

2194
01:16:43,577 --> 01:16:45,715
Let's play more games.

2195
01:16:45,715 --> 01:16:47,969
- I just got super hyped.
- Hey, this is so fun.

2196
01:16:47,969 --> 01:16:48,921
- Oh!
- I was super hyped.

2197
01:16:48,921 --> 01:16:51,183
Let's not go to places like Egypt.

2198
01:16:51,183 --> 01:16:53,652
Let's just go to Korea and play this game.

2199
01:16:53,652 --> 01:16:55,728
Which team has this much fun
playing the Apartment game?

2200
01:16:55,728 --> 01:16:58,728
It's been so much fun!
Thank you!

2201
01:16:58,728 --> 01:17:00,611
We really gave it our all…

2202
01:17:00,611 --> 01:17:04,067
- You said you had a bad feeling in the beginning.
- That's right.

2203
01:17:04,067 --> 01:17:05,702
[2 Princes, 2 Commoners, 2 Paupers]
It all fell into place.

2204
01:17:05,702 --> 01:17:06,836
[With their new statuses,]
I really tried hard.

2205
01:17:06,836 --> 01:17:08,972
[they head out to dinner]
I really tried hard.

2206
01:17:08,972 --> 01:17:13,231
[The beautiful sunset fades into the evening]

2207
01:17:13,231 --> 01:17:15,421
[Whooooosh]

2208
01:17:15,421 --> 01:17:17,847
[The wind blows even harder than during the day]
Whoa, the wind.

2209
01:17:17,847 --> 01:17:19,877
This wind is no joke.

2210
01:17:19,877 --> 01:17:22,134
[Dinner time in the strong winds]
Oh, the wind is crazy.

2211
01:17:22,134 --> 01:17:24,221
There's not a single spot blocked off here.

2212
01:17:24,221 --> 01:17:25,989
[Only 4 place settings]
But why are there only 4?

2213
01:17:25,989 --> 01:17:27,480
[Paupers]
Yo Han and I don't get any?

2214
01:17:27,480 --> 01:17:29,111
Oh, it's that for us… The bread.

2215
01:17:29,111 --> 01:17:30,711
We're getting bread…?

2216
01:17:30,711 --> 01:17:31,977
Come on… They'll at least give us food.

2217
01:17:31,977 --> 01:17:32,965
- It's bread. Dinner is bread.
- No?

2218
01:17:32,965 --> 01:17:34,543
[As usual, the paupers get bread]
Right from when you were confirmed as paupers.

2219
01:17:35,999 --> 01:17:37,537
Oh, the food is coming.

2220
01:17:39,269 --> 01:17:41,504
Hey, let us have some with you…

2221
01:17:41,504 --> 01:17:44,077
[One by one, the dishes appear]

2222
01:17:44,077 --> 01:17:47,711
[A feast worthy of the final night]

2223
01:17:47,711 --> 01:17:49,336
We'll do the seat assignments now.

2224
01:17:49,336 --> 01:17:51,161
What seat assignments?

2225
01:17:51,161 --> 01:17:53,018
[The paupers too]
Let us have our final feast too!

2226
01:17:53,018 --> 01:17:54,344
Alright, starting from the inside,

2227
01:17:54,344 --> 01:17:55,981
[Prince / Commoner / Pauper]
it'll be Prince, Commoner, Pauper.

2228
01:17:55,981 --> 01:17:57,015
Oh, okay.

2229
01:17:57,015 --> 01:17:59,444
[Reseated by status]
This is too much, seriously too much.

2230
01:17:59,444 --> 01:18:01,511
- Prince, commoner, pauper, right?
- Ah, I'm really...

2231
01:18:01,511 --> 01:18:03,177
Nice, nice! I'm good with it!

2232
01:18:03,177 --> 01:18:05,443
[Finally, Ji Sung gets his dinner feast]
Finally, Ji Sung…!

2233
01:18:05,910 --> 01:18:08,176
[Bitter]
I tried this during lunch, and they weren't great.

2234
01:18:09,119 --> 01:18:11,511
Enjoy your meal! Lee Teuk, you too…

2235
01:18:11,511 --> 01:18:13,057
[The pauper's meal is served]
Oh, come on!

2236
01:18:13,057 --> 01:18:14,977
You didn't really come dressed
like a pauper, Lee Teuk.

2237
01:18:14,977 --> 01:18:16,244
[Plating]
It looks like a hotteok! A hotteok!

2238
01:18:16,244 --> 01:18:19,040
[Upgraded from a bag to a plate]
Thank you for this food!

2239
01:18:19,040 --> 01:18:20,348
Wow!!

2240
01:18:20,348 --> 01:18:22,843
[Everyone gets excited as the wood-fired pizza arrives]
Wow, nice!

2241
01:18:23,310 --> 01:18:25,344
[The main dish is delivered to the princes' table]
- Thank you! - No, no!

2242
01:18:25,344 --> 01:18:26,842
[It's bread, though]
Wait, isn't this ours?

2243
01:18:26,842 --> 01:18:28,351
[Not a chance]
Come on, it's not.

2244
01:18:28,351 --> 01:18:29,819
[Pizza is just a dream for the paupers]
I want some pizza.

2245
01:18:29,819 --> 01:18:31,144
- Hey, the pizza! The pizza is great!
- Wow!

2246
01:18:31,144 --> 01:18:33,423
[Super excited]
This pizza is seriously insane!

2247
01:18:33,423 --> 01:18:35,843
- Thank you for this food!
- Thank you for this food!

2248
01:18:35,843 --> 01:18:38,597
- But Lee Teuk, it gets better as you eat it.
- Really?

2249
01:18:38,597 --> 01:18:40,530
[Resigned, they start eating]
I honestly couldn't tell what it taste like.

2250
01:18:40,530 --> 01:18:42,227
- It's warm.
- It's like Pyeongyang Naengmyeon style!

2251
01:18:42,227 --> 01:18:43,676
Hey, it's warm, warm.

2252
01:18:43,676 --> 01:18:45,610
[Same table / Different levels of satisfaction]
Hey, the pizza! The pizza!

2253
01:18:46,436 --> 01:18:49,244
[The wealth gap right before their eyes]
Being at the same table like this is really…

2254
01:18:49,244 --> 01:18:50,456
Lee Teuk, from earlier…

2255
01:18:50,456 --> 01:18:54,077
I remember he ate all the ramyeon
without leaving any for us.

2256
01:18:54,077 --> 01:18:56,310
[Moments ago, during the ramyeon loyalty game]
He's scooping up all the stir-fried Kimchi!

2257
01:18:56,310 --> 01:18:57,635
[After carefully gathering and gathering it all]

2258
01:18:57,635 --> 01:18:58,677
Alright, here goes his one bite.

2259
01:18:58,677 --> 01:19:00,317
- 2, 3!
- His face is already full of mischief!

2260
01:19:00,317 --> 01:19:01,918
[Grabs tightly]
Oh, that's it!

2261
01:19:01,918 --> 01:19:05,876
[With no loyalty, he ate as much as possible]

2262
01:19:05,876 --> 01:19:09,343
[People should live kindly]
Can you at least put that pizza sauce on here?

2263
01:19:09,343 --> 01:19:11,176
[Chomp]

2264
01:19:11,176 --> 01:19:12,911
[The pizza disappears in one bite]

2265
01:19:12,911 --> 01:19:14,344
[Nice]
Mmm!

2266
01:19:14,344 --> 01:19:15,544
Wow, this bread
is seriously delicious.

2267
01:19:15,544 --> 01:19:17,211
I want pizza so much right now…

2268
01:19:17,211 --> 01:19:19,611
Oh, this is nice!

2269
01:19:19,611 --> 01:19:21,944
[A cruel moment for the pizza lover]
I'm really the pizza king. I love hamburgers too.

2270
01:19:21,944 --> 01:19:24,143
[Munch]

2271
01:19:24,143 --> 01:19:25,976
[Lip smacking…]

2272
01:19:25,976 --> 01:19:27,136
Hey, what is this?

2273
01:19:27,136 --> 01:19:29,379
[Fried squid]
I think it's calamari.

2274
01:19:29,379 --> 01:19:30,844
Can I touch it just once?

2275
01:19:30,844 --> 01:19:32,444
[Grab]
No, why? Come on!

2276
01:19:32,444 --> 01:19:35,051
[Remove your filthy hands!]
Hey, come on! Why are you being like that?

2277
01:19:35,051 --> 01:19:37,136
(Nom)
I can at least touch it…

2278
01:19:37,136 --> 01:19:38,602
[Lingering sadness...]

2279
01:19:39,017 --> 01:19:40,290
So yummy, so yummy.

2280
01:19:40,290 --> 01:19:42,525
Just let us dip this in the sauce a little bit.

2281
01:19:42,525 --> 01:19:45,143
[Desperately begging for the sauce]
Just let us dip it in the sauce a little bit.

2282
01:19:45,143 --> 01:19:47,024
[We humbly request some sauce]
Can we just dip it in the sauce?

2283
01:19:47,024 --> 01:19:48,044
Please give us some sauce.

2284
01:19:48,044 --> 01:19:50,153
[The princes' mercy]
Alright, you can dip it in the sauce.

2285
01:19:50,153 --> 01:19:51,726
[Sauce granted]
The sauce.

2286
01:19:51,726 --> 01:19:53,944
[Prepared the bread right away]
But the sauce is delicious.

2287
01:19:53,944 --> 01:19:54,966
[Quickly grabbed a piece]
This sauce is seriously good.

2288
01:19:54,966 --> 01:19:56,944
Oh, hey, Lee Teuk!

2289
01:19:56,944 --> 01:19:58,344
[His sneaky move got caught]
Lee Teuk, hey!

2290
01:19:58,344 --> 01:20:00,444
- What are you doing?
- Just give me one.

2291
01:20:00,444 --> 01:20:02,443
[Dip, dip]
Come on, Lee Teuk. What are you doing?

2292
01:20:02,443 --> 01:20:04,543
[Settling for the sauce + bread]
But the sauce is tasty.

2293
01:20:04,543 --> 01:20:05,982
Roar!

2294
01:20:05,982 --> 01:20:08,643
[The happy taste of a higher status]

2295
01:20:08,643 --> 01:20:10,410
[Moved]
Wow, this sauce is really good.

2296
01:20:10,410 --> 01:20:12,011
[Going for a 2nd attempt right away]

2297
01:20:12,011 --> 01:20:13,110
2nd attempt?

2298
01:20:13,110 --> 01:20:14,476
[Careful]

2299
01:20:14,476 --> 01:20:16,144
[Just then, the wind blows powerfully]
Whoa! Hey, it's shaking here.

2300
01:20:16,144 --> 01:20:17,943
[Shaking]
The wind…! Whoa!

2301
01:20:17,943 --> 01:20:18,744
What, where did it go?

2302
01:20:18,744 --> 01:20:20,276
[Now!]

2303
01:20:22,243 --> 01:20:23,126
[Stuff]

2304
01:20:23,126 --> 01:20:26,543
[His sneaky move is successful]
Are the cats okay? It's super windy.

2305
01:20:26,943 --> 01:20:28,877
[Crunch]

2306
01:20:28,877 --> 01:20:30,674
[Honest reaction]
Hey, this is seriously good.

2307
01:20:30,674 --> 01:20:32,542
I feel like you had something else, though?

2308
01:20:32,542 --> 01:20:34,272
- Huh?
- What?

2309
01:20:34,272 --> 01:20:35,236
[Denying it]
I didn't eat it.

2310
01:20:35,236 --> 01:20:37,177
[Something's crunchy, though…?]
Why is something crunching in your mouth?

2311
01:20:37,177 --> 01:20:38,744
I chewed on some sand…

2312
01:20:38,744 --> 01:20:40,517
Oh, that's sand? I see.

2313
01:20:40,517 --> 01:20:42,586
- So you ate sand, right?
- Yes, sand. Sand!

2314
01:20:42,586 --> 01:20:43,620
Because the wind's picking up.

2315
01:20:43,620 --> 01:20:45,055
[Looking extra pitiful with his hair flying everywhere]
The sand is blowing right in.

2316
01:20:45,055 --> 01:20:46,568
That's weird.

2317
01:20:47,949 --> 01:20:49,649
Wow, but this is really delicious.

2318
01:20:49,649 --> 01:20:51,744
[Fried squid]
- But this is really good! - Right?

2319
01:20:51,744 --> 01:20:53,211
Oh, leave me some!

2320
01:20:53,211 --> 01:20:55,069
- This one?
- Yes.

2321
01:20:55,069 --> 01:20:57,100
- There aren't that many.
- Is this squid?

2322
01:20:57,100 --> 01:20:58,811
- Yes!
- It's squid!

2323
01:20:58,811 --> 01:20:59,977
How do you know, Lee Teuk?

2324
01:20:59,977 --> 01:21:01,644
[…?! LOL]
Oh.

2325
01:21:01,644 --> 01:21:03,410
- Oh, Lee Teuk?
- No, like…

2326
01:21:03,410 --> 01:21:05,515
[Author of Lee Teuk's Special Meal]
I cook a lot, so I know when I see it.

2327
01:21:05,515 --> 01:21:07,242
You scared me.

2328
01:21:09,079 --> 01:21:11,144
- Ugh! It looks so delicious!!!
- Hey Ji Sung.

2329
01:21:11,144 --> 01:21:13,177
[Making up for all the food he's missed]
I didn't know Ji Sung's mouth was this big.

2330
01:21:13,177 --> 01:21:14,384
[Whoosh]

2331
01:21:14,384 --> 01:21:16,206
Something's flying around!

2332
01:21:16,206 --> 01:21:17,587
Something's flying around here!

2333
01:21:17,587 --> 01:21:18,955
I thought it was a pigeon…

2334
01:21:18,955 --> 01:21:20,188
[Whoosh]

2335
01:21:22,910 --> 01:21:25,356
[His hair is looking unusually pitiful]
We're gonna need that later.

2336
01:21:25,356 --> 01:21:28,243
But is this shot actually okay?

2337
01:21:28,243 --> 01:21:29,477
The people watching this right now…

2338
01:21:29,477 --> 01:21:32,277
Won't they think all 6 of us are paupers?

2339
01:21:32,277 --> 01:21:34,843
DAWN must be curious about the bread.

2340
01:21:34,843 --> 01:21:36,044
[The only one with no pauper experience]
Yeah, I am kind of curious.

2341
01:21:36,044 --> 01:21:37,944
- Try one.
- Try one, DAWN!

2342
01:21:37,944 --> 01:21:39,044
- Then, let's trade! Let's trade!
- It's surprisingly not that bad.

2343
01:21:39,044 --> 01:21:40,144
[We got him!]
If you try one, you have to trade!

2344
01:21:40,144 --> 01:21:41,344
What do you want to trade with?

2345
01:21:41,344 --> 01:21:42,843
- Pizza!!
- Pizza?

2346
01:21:42,843 --> 01:21:44,544
[A generous bread-for-pizza trade]
Okay, one slice of pizza.

2347
01:21:44,544 --> 01:21:45,844
I want pepperoni!

2348
01:21:45,844 --> 01:21:46,844
- Pepperoni?
- Yeah!

2349
01:21:46,844 --> 01:21:47,913
[Even paupers have their preferences]

2350
01:21:47,913 --> 01:21:49,744
Oh, you're asking for way too much.

2351
01:21:49,744 --> 01:21:51,410
So shameless!

2352
01:21:51,976 --> 01:21:54,210
[Graciously giving 2 pieces of bread]
Here, I'll give you 2 pieces.

2353
01:21:54,810 --> 01:21:55,744
Please take care of my younger brother too.

2354
01:21:55,744 --> 01:21:57,918
- Can you give me a slice too?
- Okay.

2355
01:21:59,476 --> 01:22:00,897
Hot sauce?

2356
01:22:00,897 --> 01:22:03,697
[And he asks for hot sauce, too]

2357
01:22:06,043 --> 01:22:09,005
[Bowing respectfully before the sacred pizza]
Wow, then you've only been a pauper once?

2358
01:22:09,005 --> 01:22:12,138
[Why does he look so pitiful…?]

2359
01:22:12,723 --> 01:22:14,330
Lee Teuk! Eat it comfortably!

2360
01:22:14,330 --> 01:22:15,529
[My topping...]
Like the wind…

2361
01:22:15,529 --> 01:22:16,721
We won't take it away!

2362
01:22:16,721 --> 01:22:18,144
[I'll protect you so you don't fly away]
The wind is so strong.

2363
01:22:18,144 --> 01:22:21,169
Lee Teuk, sorry to bother you,
but you're blocking our cameras.

2364
01:22:21,169 --> 01:22:22,986
[Sliding down]
Our cameras can't film us right now.

2365
01:22:22,986 --> 01:22:26,143
[The hot sauce is here]
The Tabasco sauce is here! Oh, nice.

2366
01:22:26,143 --> 01:22:27,643
[Whoosh]

2367
01:22:27,643 --> 01:22:30,109
There's lettuce flying in the front.

2368
01:22:31,861 --> 01:22:34,561
Oh… No!

2369
01:22:36,066 --> 01:22:37,267
The pizza is seriously so good.

2370
01:22:37,267 --> 01:22:39,037
Wow!

2371
01:22:39,037 --> 01:22:40,704
Wow!!

2372
01:22:40,704 --> 01:22:42,439
[Deeply moved]
Wow!

2373
01:22:42,439 --> 01:22:44,641
- Why does this taste so good?
- It's super crunchy, right?

2374
01:22:44,641 --> 01:22:46,076
- Why are the fries so good?
- Can I try one?

2375
01:22:46,076 --> 01:22:47,110
- No.
- Oh, why?

2376
01:22:47,110 --> 01:22:49,044
- They're super crispy!
- Oh!! It fell!!

2377
01:22:49,044 --> 01:22:50,413
It fell!! It fell!!

2378
01:22:50,413 --> 01:22:51,514
- It fell!
- Oh, no!

2379
01:22:51,514 --> 01:22:52,344
[Acquired]
It fell!

2380
01:22:52,344 --> 01:22:53,159
- No, come on.
- Oh, why?

2381
01:22:53,159 --> 01:22:54,044
I'm a pauper!

2382
01:22:54,044 --> 01:22:55,347
[Confiscated]
No, I'm gonna eat this.

2383
01:22:55,347 --> 01:22:58,488
[He even took that away…]
But I'm a pauper…

2384
01:22:58,488 --> 01:23:00,816
If I couldn't see it, I would give up.

2385
01:23:00,816 --> 01:23:02,719
But since I could see it…

2386
01:23:02,719 --> 01:23:04,949
My eyes keep drifting to it,
and my hands keep reaching for it...

2387
01:23:04,949 --> 01:23:08,365
[Survival Strategy: Relentless Begging]
If I kept begging, they might give me something.

2388
01:23:08,365 --> 01:23:10,328
How can a prince eat
something off the ground?

2389
01:23:10,328 --> 01:23:11,438
It's fine.

2390
01:23:11,438 --> 01:23:13,544
[Quick Quiz Break]
Lee Teuk, how many fries am I holding up?

2391
01:23:13,544 --> 01:23:15,044
3!!!

2392
01:23:15,044 --> 01:23:16,044
How did you know?

2393
01:23:16,044 --> 01:23:17,915
[Correct-answer prize: 3 fries]

2394
01:23:17,915 --> 01:23:19,876
[I did it, Yo Han]
Wow, Yo Han!

2395
01:23:19,876 --> 01:23:21,144
- Can you give me one?
- Oh, sure.

2396
01:23:21,144 --> 01:23:23,011
- You eat 2! I'll give you 2!
- Oh, thank you!

2397
01:23:23,011 --> 01:23:24,042
[The paupers even share
the smallest pieces with each other]

2398
01:23:24,042 --> 01:23:26,343
But this is really delicious. Try some.
It's super crispy.

2399
01:23:27,044 --> 01:23:28,276
[Hop]
Whoa!!

2400
01:23:30,676 --> 01:23:32,544
[Chomp]

2401
01:23:32,544 --> 01:23:33,977
You're really eating well!

2402
01:23:33,977 --> 01:23:35,044
It's so tasty.

2403
01:23:35,044 --> 01:23:36,244
DAWN's eating more than he has so far.

2404
01:23:36,244 --> 01:23:37,311
DAWN is overeating right now.

2405
01:23:37,311 --> 01:23:38,344
Why aren't you eating?

2406
01:23:38,344 --> 01:23:39,663
I'm full.

2407
01:23:39,663 --> 01:23:41,644
- Because of the ramyeon?
- I ate a lot of ramyeon.

2408
01:23:41,644 --> 01:23:44,144
You should've saved us some ramyeon!

2409
01:23:44,144 --> 01:23:45,444
Everyone, there's ramyeon left!

2410
01:23:45,444 --> 01:23:46,443
Oh, right!

2411
01:23:46,443 --> 01:23:47,871
Oh, there's ramyeon!!

2412
01:23:47,871 --> 01:23:49,411
[Super excited that there's ramyeon left]
We can eat ramyeon in the tent, right?

2413
01:23:49,411 --> 01:23:50,743
Give us the rest.

2414
01:23:50,743 --> 01:23:51,777
Oh, but…

2415
01:23:51,777 --> 01:23:55,343
[They ate Lee Teuk's ramyeon on the beach]
We ate yours earlier, Lee Teuk.

2416
01:23:55,343 --> 01:23:56,346
[Ramyeon status]

2417
01:23:56,346 --> 01:23:57,944
[Team Shin Dong]
[Spicy stir-fried noodles, Cup ramyeon, spicy ramyeon]

2418
01:23:57,944 --> 01:23:59,343
[Team Lee Teuk]
[Kimchi stew ramyeon, spicy stir-fried noodles, jjajang ramyeon]

2419
01:23:59,343 --> 01:24:01,244
The Kimchi stew ramyeon was Lee Teuk's?

2420
01:24:01,244 --> 01:24:02,644
[Despair]
Oh, then Lee Teuk's done.

2421
01:24:02,644 --> 01:24:04,144
I still have mine!

2422
01:24:04,144 --> 01:24:07,244
[Give and Take]
Since I gave you the Omori, you should give me the rest!

2423
01:24:07,244 --> 01:24:08,577
You ate some too, Lee Teuk.

2424
01:24:08,577 --> 01:24:10,744
No, that was for the leftover game.

2425
01:24:10,744 --> 01:24:13,943
Mix and cook the jjajang ramyeon and
the spicy stir-fried noodles together and bring it over.

2426
01:24:13,943 --> 01:24:15,544
- You want me to make that?
- Yes.

2427
01:24:15,544 --> 01:24:17,843
Why are you looking at me like that?

2428
01:24:17,843 --> 01:24:19,644
Is there a hierarchy
even among the paupers?

2429
01:24:19,644 --> 01:24:21,013
No, no, that's not it.

2430
01:24:21,013 --> 01:24:22,344
Why are you looking at me like that?

2431
01:24:22,344 --> 01:24:24,244
[Pauper King]
I'm not asking you to cook anything.

2432
01:24:24,244 --> 01:24:26,176
[Hehe]
I'm just really sad, that's all.

2433
01:24:26,176 --> 01:24:27,511
What else is left over?

2434
01:24:27,511 --> 01:24:28,977
- Cup Ramyeon!
- Cup Ramyeon

2435
01:24:28,977 --> 01:24:31,434
If you add perilla powder to Cup Ramyeon,
it tastes like pork bone soup.

2436
01:24:31,434 --> 01:24:33,016
- Oh, really?
- Yeah.

2437
01:24:33,016 --> 01:24:35,543
But for me, the tastiest combo is

2438
01:24:35,543 --> 01:24:37,834
Buldak Ramyeon mixed with Chapagetti!

2439
01:24:37,834 --> 01:24:38,777
- Chapagetti?
- Oh, me too!

2440
01:24:38,777 --> 01:24:39,944
Thanks, I'll enjoy it.

2441
01:24:39,944 --> 01:24:42,143
- I ate way too much Cup Ramyeon back in Korea.
- Thanks for the food.

2442
01:24:42,143 --> 01:24:43,277
That sounds so good.

2443
01:24:43,277 --> 01:24:44,790
Even if we eat it now…

2444
01:24:45,462 --> 01:24:47,587
Don't bring that out yet!
They're all gonna eat it!

2445
01:24:47,587 --> 01:24:48,531
[Going crazy]

2446
01:24:48,531 --> 01:24:50,200
We were gonna eat that later
just by ourselves!

2447
01:24:50,200 --> 01:24:51,735
The production team
seriously can't read the room!

2448
01:24:51,735 --> 01:24:53,292
[Cluelessly brought all the leftover ramyeon]

2449
01:24:53,292 --> 01:24:54,237
[Kimchi]
Alright, the remaining…

2450
01:24:54,237 --> 01:24:56,244
Oh, Kimchi!!!!

2451
01:24:56,244 --> 01:24:58,277
[44-year-old in peak condition]
Take it out later! We're gonna eat it in our tent!

2452
01:24:58,277 --> 01:24:59,676
[Throwing a tantrum]
Agh!!!

2453
01:25:00,838 --> 01:25:03,344
[Merciful princes]
We'll give you a chance to eat it in the tent.

2454
01:25:03,344 --> 01:25:05,144
- We won't eat it.
- Oh, you're not eating it?

2455
01:25:05,144 --> 01:25:06,255
- Thank you.
- Enjoy it in the tent.

2456
01:25:06,255 --> 01:25:07,214
[Snapped out of it]
Thank you.

2457
01:25:07,214 --> 01:25:09,141
We brought the remaining cup ramyeon.

2458
01:25:09,141 --> 01:25:11,211
- Didn't you say there was Cup Ramyeon?
- There is Cup Ramyeon.

2459
01:25:11,211 --> 01:25:13,044
We packed some Cup Ramyeon...

2460
01:25:13,044 --> 01:25:14,444
But the Cup Ramyeon's gone!

2461
01:25:14,444 --> 01:25:15,544
What?!

2462
01:25:15,544 --> 01:25:16,691
- It must've blown away in the wind.
- Who did it?

2463
01:25:16,691 --> 01:25:17,894
Who is it

2464
01:25:17,894 --> 01:25:18,844
Who ate it...?

2465
01:25:18,844 --> 01:25:21,511
A serious incident has happened.

2466
01:25:21,511 --> 01:25:23,044
A Cup Ramyeon theft!

2467
01:25:23,044 --> 01:25:24,043
- Huh?
- Who is it?

2468
01:25:24,043 --> 01:25:25,643
- Seriously?
- Lee Teuk.

2469
01:25:25,643 --> 01:25:29,172
- It's someone here.
- If you get caught, there's no mercy.

2470
01:25:29,172 --> 01:25:30,644
They said it's someone in here!

2471
01:25:30,644 --> 01:25:32,244
- Wow, Lee Teuk, you ate it?
- Wow, this is legendary.

2472
01:25:32,244 --> 01:25:33,743
- It's Johnny.
- It's not you?

2473
01:25:33,743 --> 01:25:34,711
[The suspects fervently deny it]
It's not me

2474
01:25:34,711 --> 01:25:36,677
Hey, why are you suspecting me?

2475
01:25:36,677 --> 01:25:37,644
No, what is this?

2476
01:25:37,644 --> 01:25:38,844
[No one expected this]
Wait, what is this?

2477
01:25:38,844 --> 01:25:40,344
This is seriously so wrong!

2478
01:25:40,344 --> 01:25:43,976
[Who is the ramyeon thief...?]
No, no! This judge is invalid!

2479
01:25:44,454 --> 01:25:46,022
[It's a night that's very
"ALL or NOTHING" until the end]

2480
01:25:46,022 --> 01:25:47,512
- Oh, wait, wait!
- Oh, Lee Teuk!

2481
01:25:47,512 --> 01:25:48,902
- Oh, our house!
- No! No!

2482
01:25:48,902 --> 01:25:50,652
Will we be okay tomorrow?

2483
01:25:50,652 --> 01:25:53,235
[The final day of the trip is already here]
Something feels off.

2484
01:25:53,235 --> 01:25:54,549
Leggo! Leggo!

2485
01:25:54,549 --> 01:25:55,765
Let's go! Let's go!

2486
01:25:55,765 --> 01:25:57,701
[The place where WANGGEOZ arrives is…]

2487
01:25:57,701 --> 01:25:59,441
[A submarine]

2488
01:25:59,441 --> 01:26:01,476
Is this for real? This is amazing!

2489
01:26:01,476 --> 01:26:03,596
[Completely captivated by the Red Sea]
Wow, this is insane!

2490
01:26:03,596 --> 01:26:05,777
[The Mermaid Prince's Math Class]
This is the grand finale mission to wrap things up!

2491
01:26:05,777 --> 01:26:07,405
- 6 to 0!
- Is this a team challenge?

2492
01:26:07,405 --> 01:26:09,176
- It's a team challenge!
- Wow!

2493
01:26:09,176 --> 01:26:12,344
Either both the Physical Team
and the Brain Team succeed together,

2494
01:26:12,344 --> 01:26:13,744
or everyone fails together!

2495
01:26:13,744 --> 01:26:16,344
[Join forces to uncover
the hidden secrets underwater]

2496
01:26:16,344 --> 01:26:17,744
[and solve the problems]

2497
01:26:17,744 --> 01:26:19,344
- 240 times 9.
- 240 times 9.

2498
01:26:19,344 --> 01:26:21,844
[Going back and forth from heaven and hell]
What is this?!

2499
01:26:21,844 --> 01:26:22,811
Cheer up, everyone!

2500
01:26:22,811 --> 01:26:24,344
[WANGGEOZ's final mission]
I totally lost it right then.

2501
01:26:24,344 --> 01:26:26,844
I'm really losing my mind!

2502
01:26:26,844 --> 01:26:28,144
[Will we make it back safely?]
We have to pull this off. We have to!

2503
01:26:28,144 --> 01:26:30,603
Let's get on the plane!
